INVITATIONS EXPIRED

Dear <%= @lead_organizer.fullname %>,

Some invitations for your proposal "<%= @proposal.title %>" have expired and have been automatically cancelled. This frees up spots for new invitations.

EXPIRED INVITATIONS SUMMARY:

<% if @expired_organizers.any? %>
Supporting Organizers (<%= @expired_organizers.count %> expired):
<% @expired_organizers.each do |invite| %>
- <%= invite.firstname %> <%= invite.lastname %> (<%= invite.email %>)
<% end %>

<% end %>
<% if @expired_participants.any? %>
Participants (<%= @expired_participants.count %> expired):
<% @expired_participants.each do |invite| %>
- <%= invite.firstname %> <%= invite.lastname %> (<%= invite.email %>)
<% end %>

<% end %>
AVAILABLE SPOTS:
- Supporting Organizers: <%= @available_organizer_slots %> spots available
- Participants: <%= @available_participant_slots %> spots available

You can now send new invitations to fill these spots. The expired invitations have been automatically removed from your proposal's capacity count.

If you need to resend invitations to the same people, you can do so from your proposal management page.

